  "claim_ceiling": "This file specifies exact reference cases and qualification checks for the adaptive separated Kerr Mino integrator, finite-radius ZAMO tetrad and canonical Hamiltonian evaluator. The Rust implementation is not compiled or executed in this editing environment. Python/SciPy values are independent equation-level references, not Luminous Rust run results.",
  "owner": "Symtropy #4519",
  "implementation": {
